    "body": "@domenic I haven't looked into this in detail, but I believe there should be a CRLF before `--myboundary`.\r\n\r\nChrome only supports multipart/x-mixed-replace for images, but I'm not sure that's relevant to this discussion.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
